  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>哥德式RPG字型</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">介紹</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">這款哥德與中世紀風格的字型清晰易讀，將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗。此字型原是為&nbsp;<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 模組包所設計，但現已開放給大眾使用！<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基於 Typodermic Fonts 的 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffontmeme.com%252ffonts%252fvinque-font%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vinque</a> 字型。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字型採用免費字型授權（Free Font License）發布。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/636/vinque-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/558/457/2022-12-19_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/558/458/2022-12-18_23.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友一起遊玩！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享75折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:symbol;font-size:24px\">黑暗在等待...</span></p>",
